## `skills/run-tests/` — run the test suite from chat

Invoke with `/run-tests` in any Copilot chat window.

```
/run-tests                   ← run the full suite
/run-tests tests/test_foo.py ← run a specific file
/run-tests -k test_login     ← run by pattern
```

The skill will:
1. Run the tests and capture output
2. Report counts (passed / failed / skipped)
3. Show full tracebacks for failures
4. Propose fixes (but ask before applying them)

