## `agents/feature-planner.agent.md` — research-only planning agent

Open Copilot chat and select **feature-planner** from the agent picker, or use the
`plan-feature` prompt (see below).

This agent is **read-only** — it explores the codebase but never edits files.
It produces a structured implementation plan with:

- Summary of the feature
- Files to create / modify with specific paths
- Implementation checklist
{% if testing_frameworks %}- Test cases to add
{% endif %}{% if db_driver not in ("none", "nosql") %}- Migration files to create (if DB changes are needed)
{% endif %}
Once you approve the plan, hand off to the standard Copilot agent (or do it yourself).

**Usage:** Type the feature name when prompted, e.g. `user-auth`, `csv-export`.

