## Tips

- **Keep `copilot-instructions.md` current.** It's the most impactful file — stale
  context leads to worse suggestions.
- **Add new instruction files** for new file types as the project grows (e.g.
  `yaml.instructions.md` if you add complex YAML configs).
- **Skills are discoverable** — type `/` in Copilot chat to see all available skills.
- **Agents are composable** — you can add `handoffs` to the agent frontmatter to
  chain agents together for multi-step workflows.
